  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "We can build up querys, like grab the agency name of the 100-110'th entries:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 8,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "100    Department of Natural Resources\n",
       "101    Department of Natural Resources\n",
       "102    Department of Natural Resources\n",
       "103    Department of Natural Resources\n",
       "104    Department of Natural Resources\n",
       "105    Department of Natural Resources\n",
       "106    Department of Natural Resources\n",
       "107    Department of Natural Resources\n",
       "108    Department of Natural Resources\n",
       "109     Department of Juvenile Justice\n",
       "Name: Agency Name, dtype: object"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 8,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "buildings.iloc[100:110][\"Agency Name\"] # grab 1-10 entries, and print out the Agency names of those entries"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "We can use NumPy-like functions, like counting how many unique agency names are in our dataset:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 9,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "35"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 9,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "buildings[\"Agency Name\"].nunique() # how many unique agencies"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "We can also do this with categorical data, like the building status:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 10,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "array(['In Use', 'Abandon', 'In Progress'], dtype=object)"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 10,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "buildings[\"Bldg Status\"].unique() "
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
