  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Obviously, we wanna combine the two plots to make a representation of any colormap.  We'll do that by adding some matplotlib axes \"by hand\":"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 73,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
