   ],
   "source": [
    "from palettable.colorbrewer.qualitative import Set1_9\n",
    "Set1_9.show_discrete_image(size=(12,2))\n",
    "Set1_9.show_continuous_image(size=(12,2))"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Now we are going to try something new -- importing functions from a custom-build library.  The link to this file is found on today's webpage.\n",
    "\n",
    "Import some pre-defined functions from `palette_colors.py` to do some things for us.  Make sure this is saved in your jupyter notebook directory or modify your path."
   ]
